A quoted :INHERIT parent. Its compile behavior is undocumented, so
diag.inherit_qualified_name stays silent (DECISIONS.md D10). Records
whatever else the tool says about the string in that position.
-- input.ssl --
:CLASS Counter;
:INHERIT "Samples.BaseCounter";
:DECLARE nCount;

:PROCEDURE Reset;
	Me:nCount := 0;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
